+; HUD row starts are page aligned. Only WALKOUT/OFFSCREEN may use low byte
+; as horizontal byte-column. Maze entry and normal actors remain full width.
+; PLAYER_DX is compatibility-only scratch, unused by persistent sparse decode.
+; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract player_entry_width profile=render: Bound HUD entry width using the hydrated old or current framebuffer pointer; preserve full width for ordinary actors.
+player_entry_width
